        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that fetches a document by identifier from a managed NoSQL store. I will use Amazon DynamoDB as the concrete external provider, which is a fully managed NoSQL database service provided by AWS. The provider will be identifiable in the code through the use of the Boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, and the specific DynamoDB client. </thinking>\n",
